environment: $InputFileName became $nbInputFileName, $ScriptCommandLine \
became $nbScriptCommandLine and Exit/Quit became nbExit, which skips every \
later cell instead of ending the session (evaluate this cell again to reset).\
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e731459-0b8f-4be5-a309-b38d845a0fab"],

